{"speciesId":792,"names":{"fr":"Lunala","es":"Lunala","en":"Lunala","ja":"ルナアーラ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"On suppose que c’est l’évolution de Cosmog lorsqu’il s’agit d’une femelle. Son troisième œil apparaît quand il s’envole vers un autre monde."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Se dice que es la evolución final hembra de Cosmog. Su tercer ojo aparece cuando se traslada a un mundo distinto."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"It is said to be a female evolution of Cosmog. When its third eye activates, away it flies to another world."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"コスモッグが 進化した ♀だと いわれる。 第３の 眼が 浮かぶとき 別世界へと 飛び去っていく。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Cet être mystérieux viendrait d’un autre monde. Il absorbe continuellement la lumière, transformant le jour en nuit noire."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Se dice que vive en otro mundo. Devora la luz con tamaña fruición que es capaz de provocar la penumbra más absoluta en pleno día."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"Said to live in another world, this Pokémon devours light, drawing the moonless dark veil of night over the brightness of day."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"別世界に 棲むと いわれる。 光を 喰らい続け 真昼も 闇夜の ように 翳らせる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Des documents extrêmement anciens le décrivent comme « celui qui invite la lune »."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Aparece en obras de la literatura antigua en las que se refieren a él como la “criatura que invoca a la luna”."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Records of it exist in writings from long, long ago, where it was known by the name “the beast that calls the moon.”"},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"遥か 大昔の 文献に 月を 誘いし 獣と いう 名前で 記録が 残っている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il lui arrive d’invoquer dans ce monde des créatures et des puissances inconnues via une brèche menant à d’autres dimensions."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"A veces, las fisuras interdimensionales que crea sirven de pasaje para fuerzas y formas de vida desconocidas."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"It sometimes summons unknown powers and life-forms here to this world from holes that lead to other worlds."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"異世界に 通じる 穴 から 未知の 力や 生命を この 世界に 呼び寄せることも ある。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il a pour surnom « celui qui invite la lune ». Il vit en transformant toutes sortes de lumière en énergie."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Lo llaman la Criatura que Invoca a la Luna. Convierte cualquier forma de luz en energía para sustentarse."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Known as the Beast That Calls the Moon, this Pokémon lives by taking in any and all light and converting it into its own energy."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"月を 誘いし 獣 という 名前を もつ。 あらゆる 光を エネルギーに 変えて 生きている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il capture toute la lumière qui l’entoure pour prendre la forme de la pleine lune et éclairer les ténèbres nocturnes."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Devora toda la luz que haya a su alrededor y adopta la forma de una luna llena que ilumina la oscura noche."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"It steals the light from its surroundings and then becomes the full moon, showering its own light across the night sky."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"周囲から 光を すべて 奪い 自らは 満月の 姿となり 闇夜に 光を 放つ。"}],"varieties":[{"id":792,"moves":[{"name":"fly","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"roar","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0]]},{"name":"ice-beam","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"blizzard","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"hyper-beam","learns":[[17,"level-up",73],[17,"mach